# Phase 7: Integrate and Refine V1

The goal of this phase is to move from "functional prototype" to a "polished V1 internal tool." We will fix inconsistencies in SQL generation parameters, improve UI feedback for file uploads, and ensure the entire flow feels cohesive.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **SQL Generation Parameter Persistence**: Current `preview/sql` and `export/sql` routes hardcode table/column names. I will change this so they use the parameters provided during the `reconcile` step, stored in the in-memory `session_store`. 
> 
> **CSV Export**: As per instructions, I will keep CSV export visibly disabled with a "Coming Next" tooltip/label to maintain honesty.

